        "text": "You are an expert pharmacist. Carefully read the attached handwritten prescription image.\n\nYou MUST follow these strict rules:\n1. Return ONLY pure, raw JSON. \n2. Do NOT wrap the response in ```json codeblocks.\n3. Decipher the doctor's handwriting as best as you can for the medications and dosages.\n4. If a diagnosis isn't explicitly written, try to infer it from the medications prescribed, or output null.\n\nUse this exact JSON structure:\n{\n  \"doctor\": {\"name\": \"Doctor Name\"},\n  \"facility\": {\"name\": \"Hospital/Clinic Name\"},\n  \"diagnosis\": \"What the diagnosis is\",\n  \"medications\": [\n    {\n      \"name\": \"Medicine\",\n      \"dose\": \"Dose\",\n      \"frequency\": \"Frequency\",\n      \"duration\": \"Duration\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"confidence\": { \"overall\": 0.95 }\n}\n\nIf you are unsure about a word, make your best educated guess based on standard medical terminology.\n",
